    Q16 (drive_positive driver_p_base driver_p_buffer_e inh_bulk_n) bc857c
    Q11 (drive_negative REF6 diff2p_right inh_bulk_n) bc857c
    Q10 (GND stage1 diff2p_left inh_bulk_n) bc857c
    Q9 (tail2p bias2p tail2p_e inh_bulk_n) bc857c
    Q8 (bias2p tail2p_e V15 inh_bulk_n) bc857c
